{"id":"7f1ed77100bfbf2a","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-semiprojective.md","title":"Semiprojective Object","display":"df-semiprojective — Semiprojective Object","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-semiprojective","aliases":["93-df-semiprojective"],"display":"df-semiprojective — Semiprojective Object","depends_on":["[[93-df-category]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-semiprojective"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-semiprojective</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-semiprojective — Semiprojective Object"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aa74a8aadef06b6c\" href=\"?note=aa74a8aadef06b6c\" title=\"93-df-category\">93-df-category</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span>; every directed-system index <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> is required to lie in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_{B}\">\\(\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_{B}\\)</span> is the identity projection of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aa74a8aadef06b6c\" href=\"?note=aa74a8aadef06b6c\" title=\"93-df-category\">93-df-category</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirPoset}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{DirPoset}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DirArrDom}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{DirArrDom}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Epi}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Epi}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EpiDirSys}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{EpiDirSys}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirColim}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{DirColim}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Semiproj}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Semiproj}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semiprojective}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DirPoset}_{93}(I,R)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nI\\in V\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\\land R\\subseteq I^2\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\langle i,i\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in R\n\\to\\langle i,k\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle j,i\\rangle\\in R\\to i=j\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\exists k\\in I\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle i,k\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in R\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semiprojective}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DirPoset}_{93}(I,R)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nI\\in V\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\\land R\\subseteq I^2\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\langle i,i\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in R\n\\to\\langle i,k\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle j,i\\rangle\\in R\\to i=j\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\exists k\\in I\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle i,k\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in R\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semiprojective}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DirArrDom}_{93}(I,R)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in I^2:\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semiprojective}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DirArrDom}_{93}(I,R)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in I^2:\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semiprojective}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Epi}_{93}(q,B,C;\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land B,C\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\land q\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall Y\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\n\\forall g,h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C,Y)\\;\n(g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}q=h\\circ_{\\mathcal C}q\\to g=h).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semiprojective}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Epi}_{93}(q,B,C;\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land B,C\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\land q\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall Y\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\n\\forall g,h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C,Y)\\;\n(g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}q=h\\circ_{\\mathcal C}q\\to g=h).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semiprojective}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EpiDirSys}_{93}(I,R,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf q;\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{DirPoset}_{93}(I,R)\n\\land\\mathbf B:I\\to\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\n\\land\\mathbf q:\\operatorname{DirArrDom}_{93}(I,R)\\to V\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\bigl(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\to\n\\mathrm{Epi}_{93}(\\mathbf q(\\langle i,j\\rangle),\\mathbf B(i),\\mathbf B(j);\\mathcal C)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathbf q(\\langle i,i\\rangle)=\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_{\\mathbf B(i)}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;\n\\Bigl(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in R\\to\n\\mathbf q(\\langle i,k\\rangle)=\n\\mathbf q(\\langle j,k\\rangle)\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\mathbf q(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semiprojective}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EpiDirSys}_{93}(I,R,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf q;\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{DirPoset}_{93}(I,R)\n\\land\\mathbf B:I\\to\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\n\\land\\mathbf q:\\operatorname{DirArrDom}_{93}(I,R)\\to V\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\bigl(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\to\n\\mathrm{Epi}_{93}(\\mathbf q(\\langle i,j\\rangle),\\mathbf B(i),\\mathbf B(j);\\mathcal C)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathbf q(\\langle i,i\\rangle)=\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_{\\mathbf B(i)}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;\n\\Bigl(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in R\\to\n\\mathbf q(\\langle i,k\\rangle)=\n\\mathbf q(\\langle j,k\\rangle)\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\mathbf q(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semiprojective}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DirColim}_{93}(L,\\boldsymbol\\lambda;I,R,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf q;\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{EpiDirSys}_{93}(I,R,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf q;\\mathcal C)\n\\land L\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\land\\boldsymbol\\lambda:I\\to V\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(\n\\boldsymbol\\lambda(i)\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathbf B(i),L)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\to\n\\boldsymbol\\lambda(j)\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\mathbf q(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\n=\\boldsymbol\\lambda(i)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall N\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall\\boldsymbol\\mu\\;\n\\Bigl[\\bigl(\\boldsymbol\\mu:I\\to V\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\boldsymbol\\mu(i)\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathbf B(i),N)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\bigl(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\to\n\\boldsymbol\\mu(j)\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\mathbf q(\\langle i,j\\rangle)=\\boldsymbol\\mu(i)\\bigr)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}\\to\\exists!u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(L,N)\\;\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(u\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\boldsymbol\\lambda(i)=\\boldsymbol\\mu(i)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semiprojective}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DirColim}_{93}(L,\\boldsymbol\\lambda;I,R,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf q;\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{EpiDirSys}_{93}(I,R,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf q;\\mathcal C)\n\\land L\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\land\\boldsymbol\\lambda:I\\to V\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(\n\\boldsymbol\\lambda(i)\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathbf B(i),L)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\to\n\\boldsymbol\\lambda(j)\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\mathbf q(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\n=\\boldsymbol\\lambda(i)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall N\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall\\boldsymbol\\mu\\;\n\\Bigl[\\bigl(\\boldsymbol\\mu:I\\to V\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\boldsymbol\\mu(i)\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathbf B(i),N)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\bigl(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\to\n\\boldsymbol\\mu(j)\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\mathbf q(\\langle i,j\\rangle)=\\boldsymbol\\mu(i)\\bigr)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}\\to\\exists!u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(L,N)\\;\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(u\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\boldsymbol\\lambda(i)=\\boldsymbol\\mu(i)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semiprojective}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Semiproj}_{93}(A;\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land A\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall I\\;\\forall R\\;\\forall\\mathbf B\\;\\forall\\mathbf q\\;\\forall L\\;\\forall\\boldsymbol\\lambda\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{DirColim}_{93}(L,\\boldsymbol\\lambda;I,R,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf q;\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}\\to\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,L)\\;\n\\exists i\\in I\\;\\exists g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,\\mathbf B(i))\\;\n\\bigl(\\boldsymbol\\lambda(i)\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g=f\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semiprojective}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Semiproj}_{93}(A;\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land A\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall I\\;\\forall R\\;\\forall\\mathbf B\\;\\forall\\mathbf q\\;\\forall L\\;\\forall\\boldsymbol\\lambda\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{DirColim}_{93}(L,\\boldsymbol\\lambda;I,R,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf q;\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}\\to\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,L)\\;\n\\exists i\\in I\\;\\exists g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,\\mathbf B(i))\\;\n\\bigl(\\boldsymbol\\lambda(i)\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g=f\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Semiprojectivity is a factorization through some stage of every directed colimit whose transition maps are epimorphisms. The order relation, object family, transition family, and cocone families are explicit relations or function graphs.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"aa74a8aadef06b6c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"aa74a8aadef06b6c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_{B}$ is the identity projection of [[93-df-category]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_{B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirPoset}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DirArrDom}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Epi}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EpiDirSys}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirColim}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Semiproj}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semiprojective}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DirPoset}_{93}(I,R)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nI\\in V\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\\land R\\subseteq I^2\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\langle i,i\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in R\n\\to\\langle i,k\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle j,i\\rangle\\in R\\to i=j\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\exists k\\in I\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle i,k\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in R\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\ma